<title>JAPAN: Mexico cuts crude prices to Asia--traders.</title>
<headline>Mexico cuts crude prices to Asia--traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico has cut the price formula for its March-lifting Maya crude oil to Asia by 10 cents per barrel and Isthmus crude oil by 15 cents per barrel, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
